# Test instructions

Paths are relative to the supplied `project_root`, which can be below the Git root.
Use the supplied absolute `harness_root` to locate instructions, not the worker's cwd.

{{test_conventions}}

Run the suite at `project_root` with `{{test_command}}`, or scope it with
`{{test_filter_example}}`. A scoped run does not replace the required full-suite gate.
Record the actual command, cwd, exit code and result. A missing command blocks.
